"请求头会写进日志，但不会存储。`login_events`（`apps/backend/serving/storage/postgres_operational.py`）为每次登录尝试保存"
" `ip` 和 `user_agent`。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:281
msgid "Retention is yours to set"
msgstr "保留期由你自己定"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:283
msgid ""
"Nothing expires these tables on a timer. The deletions that exist are run"
" by an administrator:"
msgstr "没有任何机制按时间自动清理这些表。现有的删除操作都由管理员执行："

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:286
msgid ""
"`DELETE /admin/login-events?older_than_days=N` purges `login_events` by "
"age."
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/login-events?older_than_days=N` 按时间清理 `login_events`。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:287
msgid "`DELETE /admin/login-events?user_id=...` purges one user's login events."
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/login-events?user_id=...` 清理某个用户的登录事件。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:288
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /admin/users/{user_id}/hard-delete` deletes the user and their "
"`api_logs` rows, once permanent deletion is on; see [Secrets for deleting"
" accounts](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-accounts)."
msgstr ""
"`POST /admin/users/{user_id}/hard-delete` 删除用户及其 `api_logs` "
"行，前提是已开启永久删除；见[删除账号所用的密钥](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-accounts)。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:291
msgid "`POST /admin/recent-requests/clear-errors` drops recent error rows."
msgstr "`POST /admin/recent-requests/clear-errors` 删除最近的错误行。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:293
msgid ""
"If you are subject to a data-protection regime, or do not want to keep "
"client addresses indefinitely, set and run a retention policy yourself; "
"the project ships none. Prompts and responses are stored only with "
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` on; see [Request logging and privacy](database.md"
"#request-logging-and-privacy)."
msgstr ""
"如果你受数据保护法规约束，或者不想无限期保存客户端地址，请自行制定并执行保留策略；本项目不提供。只有开启 "
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` 时才会存储提示词和响应；见[请求日志与隐私](database.md#request-"
"logging-and-privacy)。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:298
msgid "Testing your setup"
msgstr "验证你的配置"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:304
msgid ""
"These cover resolution, Pseudo IPv4, bucketing and spoofing cases; CIDR "
"validation; and the log fields. On a live gateway, send a request with an"
" absurd forwarded header and read `ip_source` in its log line to see "
"which rule the gateway believed."
msgstr ""
"这些测试覆盖地址解析、Pseudo IPv4、分组和伪造场景，CIDR "
"校验，以及日志字段。在运行中的网关上，发送一个带荒唐转发请求头的请求，再查看对应日志行中的 `ip_source`，就能知道网关采信了哪条规则。"

